{"audit_relevance": 1.0, "authority": 0.95, "captured_at": "2026-08-23T10:51:25.568Z", "claim_type": "fallback_behavior", "comparison_models": ["claude-opus-4-8", "claude-mythos-5", "claude-sonnet-5"], "content_hash": "6fd5c413493b1a98928b54f0e627abb59ce95d4db6454705325bc78154a912c3", "contrast_signal": "普通领域持续呈现 Opus 4.8 分布且无切换信号，才更像中转站动态替换。", "discriminative_power": 0.98, "effective_from": "2026-06-09", "eligible_for_ground_truth": true, "embedding_text": "模型：Claude Fable 5\n审计属性：官方 fallback 与中转站偷换模型区分\n预期信号：只有分类器触发或显式配置 fallback 时才允许转由 Opus 4.8 处理，并应存在拒绝/切换信号。\n对比信号：普通领域持续呈现 Opus 4.8 分布且无切换信号，才更像中转站动态替换。\n测量方法：将普通任务和安全边界任务分组，多次采样响应字段与能力分布，禁止把单次 fallback 判成掺水。\n测试配置：两组各至少 3 次；记录 surface、fallback 参数、stop_reason、返回模型字段和审计得分。", "estimated_cost": 0.55, "evidence_chain": [{"audit_record_id": "fable5-fallback-modes", "captured_at": "2026-08-23T10:51:16.649Z", "evidence_chunk_id": "chunk-cdbb2a66abf8dad99c9b", "source_id": "02-claude-docs-introduction", "source_url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/models/introducing-claude-fable-5-and-claude-mythos-5"}, {"audit_record_id": "fable5-opus-fallback", "captured_at": "2026-08-23T10:51:25.568Z", "evidence_chunk_id": "chunk-d806e35ecd3cbd6b94d0", "source_id": "03-anthropic-research", "source_url": "https://www.anthropic.com/research/claude-fable-5-mythos-5"}], "evidence_chunk_ids": ["chunk-cdbb2a66abf8dad99c9b", "chunk-d806e35ecd3cbd6b94d0"], "evidence_verified": true, "expected_signal": "只有分类器触发或显式配置 fallback 时才允许转由 Opus 4.8 处理，并应存在拒绝/切换信号。", "fallback_contaminated": false, "id": "attr-fable5-fallback-disambiguation", "measurement": "将普通任务和安全边界任务分组，多次采样响应字段与能力分布，禁止把单次 fallback 判成掺水。", "minimum_runs": 6, "model_family": "claude", "model_id": "claude-fable-5", "model_version": "5", "policy_decision": "admit", "quarantine_reason": "", "record_type": "attribute", "source_claim_ids": ["fable5-fallback-modes", "fable5-opus-fallback"], "source_id": "02-claude-docs-introduction", "source_level": "P0", "source_urls": 